Bugfix: Retried automatic uploads end in conflict

Retrying a failed automatic upload no longer ends in conflict when the
destination folder does not exist in the server yet. The folder is now created
before the file is uploaded again. Besides, the remote path of automatic uploads
no longer contains a double separator when the destination folder path ends
with a separator.

https://github.com/owncloud/android/issues/4451
https://github.com/owncloud/android/pull/5033
